name: sim.getCollectionHandle
description:  Collections should be dynamically be created via sim.createCollection and sim.addItemToCollection.
luaSynopsis: int collectionHandle=sim.getCollectionHandle(string collectionName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. collectionName: name of the collection. If the name is appended by a "@silentError" suffix, then no error will be output if the collection does not exist.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. Handle of the collection, or -1 in case of an error
